Column name: area_of_Impact_associated_with_the_event Type: INT64 Description: This data element identifies the impact point, if any, on this in-transport motor vehicle that produced property damage or personal injury in this event. For more info on the codes, please look at <C18 Area of Impact Associated with the Event> section in the pdf: https://crashstats.nhtsa.dot.gov/Api/Public/ViewPublication/812315
