Some few-shot examples may be useful:
Query:
--Description: 1) Basic crash-level snapshot with calculated delay_to_scene and delay_to_hospital.
SELECT
  `consecutive_number`,
  `hour_of_crash`,
  `hour_of_arrival_at_scene`,
  `hour_of_ems_arrival_at_hospital`,
  (`hour_of_arrival_at_scene` - `hour_of_crash`)  AS delay_to_scene,
  (CASE WHEN `hour_of_ems_arrival_at_hospital` BETWEEN 0 AND 23
        THEN `hour_of_ems_arrival_at_hospital` - `hour_of_crash` END) AS delay_to_hospital,
  `type_of_intersection`,
  `light_condition`,
  `atmospheric_conditions_1`,
  `number_of_fatalities`
FROM `bigquery-public-data.nhtsa_traffic_fatalities.accident_2015`
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
consecutive_number,hour_of_crash,hour_of_arrival_at_scene,hour_of_ems_arrival_at_hospital,delay_to_scene,delay_to_hospital,type_of_intersection,light_condition,atmospheric_conditions_1,number_of_fatalities
