Query:
--Description: 10) First vs. most harmful events for vehicles, capped when values ≥ 90.
SELECT
  `consecutive_number`,
  `first_harmful_event`,
  `most_harmful_event`,
  CASE WHEN `first_harmful_event` < 90 THEN `first_harmful_event` ELSE 0 END AS first_event_capped,
  CASE WHEN `most_harmful_event`  < 90 THEN `most_harmful_event`  ELSE 0 END AS most_event_capped
FROM `bigquery-public-data.nhtsa_traffic_fatalities.vehicle_2015`
LIMIT 20
Answer:
consecutive_number,first_harmful_event,most_harmful_event,first_event_capped,most_event_capped
